#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0362 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: The value of ASTDTM is greater than the value of AENDTM, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
#note "H2 guard scenario (WORKORDER-H2-guard-coverage / REVIEW1-order-flip.tsv): AENDTM - the low operand - is a BLANK cell in a numeric ADaM datetime column (MissingValue.MIS), and the not empty(AENDTM) guard silences the rule despite a populated ASTDTM. If this FIRES, the order-flip guard was deleted: post-6c totality positions MIS below every number, so ASTDTM > MIS becomes true."
dataset ADLBC
col ASTDTM type=Num
col AENDTM type=Num
